{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11211720","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211720","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121172001:1":{"text":"다들 고생하셨어요! 저희는 영혼의 언덕 근처에서 그 어떤 이상도 발견하지 못했어요... 미안해요.","source_cn":"几位辛苦了。十分抱歉，我们没在鹿灵圣丘附近发现任何异常。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2084D1FF1894BA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121172002:1":{"text":"여러분은 무언가 발견하신 게 있나요?","source_cn":"不知各位有什么发现？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB08490C0E7A6D191","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121172003:1":{"text":"흠... 악마는 찾지 못했지만, 아주아주 큰 발견이 하나 있긴 했어요...","source_cn":"呃……我们没找到恶魔，但是另外有一个很大很大的发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7405E225715454D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121172004:1":{"text":"그래요?! 잘됐네요!","source_cn":"是吗，那是好事呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07CA34E17987998C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121172005:1":{"text":"근데... 다들 표정이... 왜 그렇죠?","source_cn":"……你们怎么了？为什么这副表情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33785EABDB356B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121172006:1":{"text":"그, 그게... 탈렌 양이...","source_cn":"因为，有关塔琳小姐……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE842B67731CAB03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173001:":{"text":"죄송해요, 제가 좀 늦었죠. 북쪽에서는 악마의 흔적을 발견하지 못...","source_cn":"抱歉，我回来晚了。北方没发现任何恶魔的踪迹——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x143D51CCD9B1547D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173002:":{"text":"왔구나.","source_cn":"你来了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3253F97C959B6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173003:":{"text":"넌 누구지?!","source_cn":"你是谁？！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C1C4748FC574A61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:15:1121173004:":{"text":"어라? 두 명?!","source_cn":"咦，有两个塔琳殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F53CE31539F6190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1121172007:1":{"text":"너... 너구나. 악마의 힘으로 복제된 탈렌이?","source_cn":"你是……我明白了，是恶魔力量所做出的复制体吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB933C566F45A35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121172008:1":{"text":"누가 복제된 탈렌인지는 아직 모르는 거지?","source_cn":"谁是复制体还未可知。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D3672E03E2D5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121172009:1":{"text":"하... 나도 악마의 힘에 영향을 받을 줄이야...","source_cn":"没想到，原来我也被恶魔的力量影响了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF97356502BBEDC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1121172010:1":{"text":"세상에... 치피가 직접 보고도 믿기지 않아요... 정말 완전히 똑같네요!","source_cn":"呜哇，满满眼睛都花了……两个塔琳小姐完全一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC60CF71A288C291","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1121172011:1":{"text":"대화를 나눌 때는 상냥하고 친절하지만, 악마에 관련된 일이라면 엄격하고... 전혀 구분할 수 없어요!","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1121172011":{"text":"대화를 나눌 때는 상냥하고 친절하지만, 악마에 관련된 일이라면 엄격하고... 전혀 구분할 수 없어요!","source_cn":"交谈的时候温柔又亲切，但一旦遇到了恶魔相关的事情就雷厉风行……已经完全分不出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6303CE520548474D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1121172012:1":{"text":"엥? 으익?! 이, 이걸 어떻게 구별해야 하죠?!","source_cn":"咦？唉？！这、这怎么分得出来呢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7FD037D7CB546F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1121172013:1":{"text":"같은 모습, 같은 말투... 설마 생각까지...?","source_cn":"同样的样貌，同样的语气……思想又如何呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47E5E0958188F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1121172014:1":{"text":"악마의 창조물은 이 세상에서 사라져야 해. 거기 또 다른 나, 너도 그렇게 생각하지?","source_cn":"恶魔的造物，应该从这个世界上消失——另一个我，你是这么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC03D516369A08C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1121172015:1":{"text":"...역시 완전히 똑같아.","source_cn":"……果然完全一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA19E755A7D26D618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1121172016:1":{"text":"그렇다면 방법은 딱 한 가지... 신이 주신, 모든 악을 불태울 수 있는 신성한 화염.","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:33:1121172016":{"text":"그렇다면 방법은 딱 한 가지... 신이 주신, 모든 악을 불태울 수 있는 신성한 화염.","source_cn":"那么，我想只有一个方法了……神明所赐的，能够烧却一切邪恶的神圣火焰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AF99314944101B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1121172017:1":{"text":"신성한 불꽃은 진정한 반신을 해치지 않아. 사악은 타들어 감으로써 정화되고, 선함만이 남게 되지.","source_cn":"神圣的火焰不会伤害真正的半神，邪恶被烧灼净化，良善依旧留存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F37F012F0336BB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1121172018:1":{"text":"악마의 창조물은 사라진다는 것, 그뿐이야.","source_cn":"恶魔的造物会消失，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA29107F9C37E29F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1121172019:1":{"text":"하지만 그렇게 되면 탈렌 양 한 명은 이 세상에서 완전히 사라지게 되잖아요! 자신이 복제된 탈렌인지 아닌지도 모르는데...","source_cn":"但是那样的话，就会有一个塔琳小姐彻底从世界上消失了！你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46C9AC42A9B29424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1121172020:1":{"text":"두 탈렌 님, 전 두 분의 말과 행동에서 그 어떤 사악한 의도도 느끼지 못했어요!","source_cn":"两位塔琳殿下，我从你们的话语和行动中感受不到任何邪恶的意图！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7CA89F9BD0E1AA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1121172021:1":{"text":"제가 봤을 때, 두 분은 모두 진실되고 신성해요... 정말 이 방법밖에는 없는 걸까요?","source_cn":"你们在我看来，都真实又神圣……真的只有这个办法吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF270AC3FE1FD37D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1121172022:1":{"text":"악마의 창조물은 절대 이 세상에 남아 있어서는 안 된다는 사실을 기억하세요. 만약 그 악마의 창조물이 저라고 해도 사라져야 마땅하다는 것을요.","source_cn":"请记住，恶魔的造物决不能存留于世，如果那恶魔的造物是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E3669785208D70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1121172023:1":{"text":"정말 진짜와 가짜가 있다면 전 스스로의 화염에 불타 재가 되고 싶어요.","source_cn":"如果真的身为虚假，那么我愿意被自己的火焰烧为灰烬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61A50F03080FC358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1121172024:1":{"text":"지키기 위해선 각오가 필요해요. 과거에 그 누군가의 희생 덕분에 오늘날의 제가 있는 거고요.","source_cn":"想要守护，就必须做出觉悟。曾经也有人立身在我身前，因为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE07A495B3BF43DF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1121172025:1":{"text":"이제, 우리가 결단을 내릴 때예요.","source_cn":"现在，是我们做出决断的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B5B2697B06120BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1121172026:1":{"text":"그렇다면... 자.","source_cn":"那么……来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEE019EA4F19A2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175001:":{"text":"신성한 화염이여... 타올라라!","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:51:1121175002:":{"text":"신성한 화염이여... 타올라라!","source_cn":"神圣的火焰——燃烧吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0985FF7BFCC384CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:54:1101021165:0":{"text":"두 탈렌은 사라지는 한이 있더라도 스스로를 증명하고 싶어했다. 두 탈렌이 신성한 불꽃 속으로 사라진 뒤, 어느새 우리 앞에는 단 한 명의 탈렌만이 남았다.","source_cn":"两个塔琳愿意证明自身，即便就此消失也无所谓。她们走进神...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBC1EC70FB991ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:0:1":{"text":"화염으로 자신을 정화하려고...?","source_cn":"你要用火焰净化自己……？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68B1B7CB7B32840F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"화염으로 자신을 정화하려고...?","female":"화염으로 자신을 정화하려고...?","variant_male_record_index":"59182","variant_female_record_index":"59183","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:33:1:2":{"text":"침착해, 바보 같은 짓 말고!","source_cn":"冷静一下，别做傻事！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0440DFCAF6A552F8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"침착해, 바보 같은 짓 말고!","female":"침착해, 바보 같은 짓 말고!","variant_male_record_index":"59184","variant_female_record_index":"59185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"우리가 처음에 본 사람이 본인 맞아?","source_cn":"我们最开始见到的，是本人吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB94B4C7E7DDF8CB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리가 처음에 본 사람이 본인 맞아?","female":"우리가 처음에 본 사람이 본인 맞아?","variant_male_record_index":"59176","variant_female_record_index":"59177","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:1:2":{"text":"너희의 신분을 증명해 봐!","source_cn":"请你们验明正身吧！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xADE3A5C378EFDC0A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너희의 신분을 증명해 봐!","female":"너희의 신분을 증명해 봐!","variant_male_record_index":"59178","variant_female_record_index":"59179","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:2:3":{"text":"네가 진짜라는 것을 설명해 봐!","source_cn":"请就“自己才是真身”展开辩述！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA73B82D0630770","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 진짜라는 것을 설명해 봐!","female":"네가 진짜라는 것을 설명해 봐!","variant_male_record_index":"59180","variant_female_record_index":"59181","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:55:1101021164:0":